OL,3,GNEWSACapita pension backlog leaves
OL,4,Awidows 'in tears'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople waiting for civil service
OL,7,Fpensions have described feeling upset,
OL,8,Ffrustrated and ignored as a growing
OL,9,Fbacklog leaves some without payments
OL,10,Ffor months.
OL,12,FAnne Sinclaire, from Minchinhampton in
OL,13,FGloucestershire, has been waiting six
OL,14,Fmonths for her widow's pension from
OL,15,FGCHQ in Cheltenham after her husband
OL,16,FBrian died in March.
OL,18,F"It makes me so angry," she said. "To
OL,19,Fcut funds off entirely from people
OL,20,Fgoing through bereavement is cruel."
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
